  "name": "Kobold",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The kobolds are a race of mole-like creatures who have excavated a warren of tunnels beneath O'Ghomoro, seeking to divine Titan's teachings through alchemy and metallurgy.</p><h2>Standard Racial Traits</h2><ul><li><strong>Ability Score Modifiers</strong>: Kobolds gain +2 Dexterity, +2 Intelligence, and -2 Charisma.</li><li><strong>Size</strong>: Kobolds are Medium creatures.</li><li><strong>Type</strong>: Kobolds are humanoids with the kobold subtype.</li><li><strong>Base Speed</strong>: Kobolds have a base speed of 30 feet and burrow speed of 20 feet.</li><li><strong>Languages</strong>: Kobolds start off knowing Terran and Common. They can learn any of the beastmen languages.</li></ul><h3>Defense Racial Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Bond to the Land</strong>: Kobolds gain a +2 dodge bonus to AC when in caves and rocky terrain.</li><li><strong>Reckless Work</strong>: Kobolds receive a +4 racial bonus on Constitution checks and Fortitude saves to avoid fatigue and exhaustion.</li><li><strong>Thick Hide</strong>: Kobolds gain a +1 natural armor bonus.</li></ul><h3>Feat and Skill Racial Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Cave Dweller</strong>: Kobolds gain a +1 racial bonus on Knowledge (dungeoneering) and Survival checks made underground.</li><li><strong>Master Tinker</strong>: Kobolds gain a +1 racial bonus on Disable Device checks, and are treated as proficient with any non-exotic weapon they have personally crafted.</li></ul><h3>Offense Racial Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Hatred</strong>: Kobolds gain a +2 attack bonus against Roegadyn-Galka of Lominsa.</li></ul><h3>Senses Racial Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Low-Light Vision</strong>: Kobolds have low-light vision, allowing them to see twice as far as humes in dim light.</li></ul><h3>Social Racial Traits</h3><ul><li><strong>Emissary</strong>: Once per day, kobolds can roll twice when making a Bluff or Diplomacy check and take the better roll.</li></ul>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
